        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Silk damask rank badge, one of a set of two. Embroidered with coloured silks with some couched gold thread showing a a single crane holding the plant of eternal youth amongst stylized clouds, rocks and surging waves.\nThe remainder of the ground is embroidered with highly stylised waves, mountains and clouds. Out of the central rock outcrop stems a fungus plant which is partly embroidered with couched gold thread. The two badgess are similar in style, detail and execution."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/a8611823-274d-3e0d-bb99-ea8fc2617788> .

